@startuml audit-domain
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam monochrome false
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
skinparam ClassBorderColor #555555
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam nodesep 60
skinparam ranksep 50

title 4/4 — Auditoría: Logs de Actividad

class AuditLog {
  +UUID id
  +String uid «AUD-»
  +UUID userId
  +String userEmail
  +String action
  +String details?
  +String ipAddress?
  +Date createdAt
}

class AuditService {
  +{static} logAction(userId, userEmail, action, details?, req?)
  +{static} logSystemAction(action, details?, req?, userId?, userEmail?)
}

class EventAuditMiddleware {
  +auditHttpEvents(req, res, next)
}

AuditService --> AuditLog : escribe
EventAuditMiddleware --> AuditService : usa

note right of AuditLog
  <b>Registro inmutable de actividades</b>
  Cada acción del sistema genera un log:
  • LOGIN, REGISTER
  • CREATE_PAYMENT, VERIFY_PAYMENT
  • REGISTER_MEAL
  • CREATE_STUDENT, UPDATE_STUDENT
  • CREATE_SUPERVISOR, etc.

  <b>IP</b> desde x-forwarded-for o socket
end note

note right of AuditService
  <b>logAction</b> — acciones de usuario
  <b>logSystemAction</b> — acciones del
  sistema (cron, middleware HTTP)

  Errores capturados silenciosamente
  para no interrumpir el flujo principal
end note

note bottom of EventAuditMiddleware
  Se ejecuta en TODAS las rutas /api/*
  Registra: method, path, statusCode,
  elapsedMs, role, query y body sanitizado
  (redacta passwords, tokens, etc.)
end note

@enduml
